Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 08:35:43 +1100
Subject: art: CHANGE button shows a creature's head stepping forward; title
 words on a solid plaque

CHANGE was two swap arrows, which say nothing about Pokemon. It is now our own
made-up creature head coming in front of a greyed one, with an arrow.
The LITTLE TRAINERS banner was thin letters with a see-through background over
the flames and horizon; it is now a navy plaque with an orange border.

